<LegalLayout title="Support — Convertly FX" description="Support and help for the Convertly FX iOS app.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Convertly FX</p>
  <h1>Support</h1>

  <p>Convertly FX is a simple currency converter. Enter an amount, choose two currencies, and get an instant conversion. Tap the swap button to reverse them. The app uses live exchange rates when you&rsquo;re online and keeps working with your last saved rates when you&rsquo;re offline.</p>

  <h2>Common questions</h2>

  <h2>Do I need an account?</h2>
  <p>No. There&rsquo;s no sign-up and no login — just open the app and convert.</p>

  <h2>Does it work without internet?</h2>
  <p>Yes. When you&rsquo;re offline, Convertly FX uses the most recent rates it downloaded, so you can still convert.</p>

  <h2>Why is a rate slightly different from my bank?</h2>
  <p>Exchange rates in the app are for general reference. Banks and card providers add their own margins and fees, so their rate may differ.</p>

  <h2>How do I switch between dark and light mode?</h2>
  <p>Use the theme toggle in the app. Your choice is remembered next time.</p>

  <h2>Is my data collected?</h2>
  <p>No. The app collects no personal information, has no ads, and no tracking. See our <a href="/convertly/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>Need more help?</h2>
  <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@mikhailnarbekov.com">support@mikhailnarbekov.com</a>. We aim to reply within a few business days.</p>
</LegalLayout>
